cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the article and this archived repository."
title: "Vivli Platform Outcomes and Impact: Analysis Code and Data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and underlying data used to produce the metrics and figures
  reported in the Vivli platform paper, covering approved data access requests
  and resulting public disclosures from December 2018 through December 2025.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-10
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/askarlupka/vivli-cell-patterns"
keywords:
  - clinical trial data sharing
  - data reuse
  - research impact
  - bibliometrics
  - open data
